<title>UK: Glynwed down as SBC Warburg cuts to &quot;hold&quot;.</title>
<headline>Glynwed down as SBC Warburg cuts to &quot;hold&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Glynwed Plc dropped on Tuesday as analysts at SBC Warburg cut the stock to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;buy&quot; and trimmed earnings estimates by some five percent, market sources said.</p>
<p>The stock was down 8-1/2p at 336-1/2 by 1020 GMT.</p>
<p>Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
